# ProductCard

Figma: **4.14 Product card** — rasm, nom, tavsif, narx va qo'shish amali. `layout`: `vertical` (2 ustunli to'r) · `horizontal` (menyu ro'yxati) · `featured` (aksiya, tavsiya).

```tsx
<ProductCard
  image={<img src={p.photo} alt="" />}
  title={p.name}
  href={`/p/${p.id}`}
  price={<Price amount={p.price} currency="soʻm" />}
  badge="Yangi"
  quantity={cart[p.id] ?? 0}
  onAdd={() => add(p.id)}
  onQuantityChange={(q) => setQty(p.id, q)}
  addLabel="Qo'shish"
/>
```

Holatlar: `quantity > 0` — tugma o'rnida `Stepper` (In cart); `unavailable` — xira, amal o'chirilgan.

# TimeSlotPicker

Figma: **3.15 Time slot picker** + **Time slot** — yetkazish yoki band qilish oynasini tanlash: kun (SegmentedControl) + oynalar to'ri (qatorda 3 ta) + izoh. Express oyna birinchi.

```tsx
<TimeSlotPicker
  title="Yetkazish vaqti"
  days={days}
  day={day}
  onDayChange={setDay}
  slots={[
    { value: 'x', time: '25–35 daq', note: '+5 000 soʻm', express: true },
    { value: 'a', time: '12:00–12:30', note: 'Bepul' },
  ]}
  value={slot}
  onChange={setSlot}
/>
```

Oynalar — radio guruh (← → bilan); `disabled` — to'lgan oyna; tanlangan — `accent/default`.
